# The beaches of Alola: Big Wave Beach on Melemele and the Secluded Shore of Ula'ula, sun on the water and the surf
# running in. A steel drum's tune in G over a strummed ukulele, a bamboo flute drifting above it in long notes, a rolling
# bass, a marimba on the offbeats and hand drums with a shaker; at night a vibraphone, a harp and an ocarina.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
title Beach (Alola)
tempo 124
meter 4/4
reverb 0.3
nighttempo 0.92
room hall 1.7

